###

# @name loginFinanzas
POST {{baseUrl}}/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "finanzas",
  "password": "Finanzas123!"
}

###


### Listar clientes activos
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

### Obtener un cliente por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

### Id inexistente -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

### ===== RBAC por rol =====
### finanzas tiene lectura de clientes -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{loginFinanzas.response.body.access_token}}

### finanzas NO puede crear clientes -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/clientes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginFinanzas.response.body.access_token}}

{ "tipo_documento": "NIT", "numero_documento": "1", "nombre": "x" }

### creativo NO tiene concesión sobre clientes -> 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCreativo.response.body.access_token}}

### sin token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes
